    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d716">

                <pb facs="0683" n="671" sameAs="frus:frus1939v01/pg671"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">811.04418/553a</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">President Roosevelt to
                        the British Prime Minister</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Chamberlain</hi>)<anchor n="21" xml:id="d716-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1939-09-11">September 11, 1939</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">My Dear Mr. Chamberlain</hi>: I need not tell you
                    that you have been much in my thoughts during these difficult days and further
                    that I hope you will at all times feel free to write me personally and outside
                    of diplomatic procedure about any problems as they arise.</p>
                <p>I hope and believe that we shall repeal the embargo within the next month and
                    this is definitely a part of the Administration policy.</p>
                <p>With my sincere regards</p>
                <p>Faithfully yours,</p>
                <closer>[<signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Franklin D. Roosevelt</hi>
                    </signed>]</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
